message: "If you cite this computational research thesis, please use the metadata below. No DOI is minted here; do not invent one."
type: thesis
title: "Encoding a compartmental AgNP-exosome-Raman theranostic concept as a multi-observation Disease Profile research object"
authors:
  - family-names: Ogbonna
    given-names: Kelechi Emeka
    email: kelechiogbonna300@gmail.com
    alias: cloudynirvana
abstract: >-
  Nanobiocomposite proposals often fuse photothermal/ROS, exosome delivery,
  and Raman sensing into one platform story; without named observation
  channels and refusal rules, those layers collapse into a single
  "nanotherapy works" claim. The concept is encoded as a Disease Profile
  with three channels and an empty therapeutic parameter list. On a toy
  linear map the legal Fisher rank is 3 of 3. A merged symbol theta has
  rank 1 of 1 and a closed profile at 1.060, against a damage coefficient
  of 0.42. A product of reporter gain and damage coefficient has a flat
  profile along the hyperbola. Not a medical device.
keywords:
